</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>You need to shout but once,</l><l>And you will win;</l><l>Oh, do not shut your mouth</l><l>And lose therein.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If pressed your spirit is</l><l>And powerless,</l><l>Pray thru the precious blood,</l><l>Victorious.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The foe though fierce, you can</l><l>Still fight with him;</l><l>If you will keep your stand,</l><l>You soon will win.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Therefore you must declare</l><l>Christ’s victory;</l><l>The situation dark</l><l>Soon changed will be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
